WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:04.400
It was the long-awaited day all those who loved him had yearned for.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:13.400
<b>August 4th: Kadonouchi Hotel</b>

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.440
<i>On this day, at this hotel,</i>

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.030
<i>a special press conference 
was slated to take place.</i>

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.900
<i>The conference hall was 
packed with reporters.</i>

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.660
<i>Cameras lined the walls.</i>

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.750
<i>And amidst them stood the young 
actor who was the talk of the town.</i>

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:30.130
<i>While every reporter in the room's 
attention was focused solely upon him,</i>

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.130
<i>just outside, another waited.</i>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:39.000
<i>With a demure, girlish build,</i>

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.970
<i>and his calm, resolved face,</i>

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.350
<i>he was to be the true star of the day, 
though no one yet knew it.</i>

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.310
Sena Izumi

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:48.310
<i>Sena Izumi.</i>

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.290
<i>His father, Sena Seiya.</i>

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:55.700
<i>His mother, Sena Nagisa.</i>

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.450
<i>And his older brother, Shougo of CRUSHERZ.</i>

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>Born into a family of entertainers,</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.960
<i>he faced his own struggles and frustrations.</i>

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.330
<i>Until finally, he made a certain 
promise to those close to him.</i>

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.740
<i>Sena Izumi.</i>

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.310
<i>Join us now as we follow him on his path</i>

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:13.670
<i>to his public revelation 
and entertainment debut.</i>

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.970
<b><i>Love Stage</i></b>

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.970
<b>Men's Style</b>

00:02:49.020 --> 00:03:06.790
<b>Love Stage
Men's Style</b>

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.810
<b>August 2nd: The Sena Household</b>

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.780
<i>With his debut drawing near,</i>

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.990
<i>Izumi's heart is wracked with confusion.</i>

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.620
<i>I'm not your big brother.</i>

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.330
Take a good look.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:10.210
Could this be... love?

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.060
Who said anything about love?!

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:14.310
Who's in love? Me?!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.710
With Ryouma?!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:21.430
But that... really, truly would be BL!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.960
No!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.640
Anything but that!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.410
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:31.700
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.520
<i>Izumi-kun—</i>

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.860
<i>That's right!</i>

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.400
<i>There's no way I could be in love with a guy.</i>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.760
<i>It's just because he was nice to 
me when I was feeling vulnerable.</i>

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:42.680
<i>I just got little confused, that's all!</i>

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.990
<i>This is all just a mix-up!</i>

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.750
<i>After all, I already have Lala-Lulu.</i>

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.330
<i>Good morning!</i>

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.710
Squee!

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.800
Did I just say "squee"? What 
the heck was I squeeing for?!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.470
Get it together, Izumi!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.170
That blood-curdling scream... is that Izumi?

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:12.390
Yes. His emotions must be running a bit high.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:15.540
His debut is in two short days, after all.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.780
I don't want to feel this way anymore!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.880
<i>This was not the first time</i>

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.740
<i>Izumi was to be in the public eye.</i>

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.160
<i>Ten years ago,</i>

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:31.370
<i>he served as a last-minute substitute 
actor at a commercial taping.</i>

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.250
<i>However, a particular incident occurred,</i>

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:47.000
<i>and left a deep scar upon his heart.</i>

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.970
<i>His father is a singer.</i>

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.150
<i>His mother is an actress.</i>

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:57.650
<i>His older brother is the 
vocalist of a popular band.</i>

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.460
<i>Within this illustrious family of entertainers...</i>

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.280
<i>Izumi-kun! Good morning!</i>

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.280
<b>Lala-Lulu</b>

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.280
<b>I'll give my heart to you-lulu!</b>

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>Go out there and do your best 
today! Love-love, Lala-Lulu!</i>

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.790
<i>I want to become a manga 
artist like Saotome-sensei!</i>

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.410
<i>And I want to draw a manga like <i>Lala-Lulu!</i></i>

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.790
<i>...he alone remained locked 
away in a world of his own.</i>

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.720
<i>However, a turning point lay ahead for him.</i>

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:35.010
<i>One fateful meeting would 
profoundly change his life.</i>

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.480
Izumi's finally making his debut!

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.340
I can't wait!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.900
Yes, indeed.

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.150
Thank you, Rei.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:49.870
It was nothing.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.580
I wonder if I'll be able 
to get under par 200 today.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.580
Just swing assertively, my 
dear, and you'll be fine.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.540
In fact, you should be allowed a 100-stroke 
handicap for those gorgeous legs alone.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.600
Oh, Seiya!

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.130
Come home safely.

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:06.680
How long have you been there, Izumi-san?!

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:07.950
Hey, Rei...

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.040
Is there any way I can avoid making my debut?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.320
Huh? What are you saying now?

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:15.120
You were the one who said 
you'd decided to do it!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.880
Where has all that determination gone?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:20.240
Now that I've thought about it, 
maybe it <i>is</i> too much for me.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.640
Where are these cowardly 
thoughts coming from?

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.190
Both Seiya-san and Nagisa-san

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.940
are looking forward to your 
debut with such high hopes—

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:29.930
Don't say stuff like that to me right now!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:30.700
Izumi-san!

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.100
For heaven's sake!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.080
No one understands me.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:42.380
<i>Now, let us take note 
of a certain video tape.</i>

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.020
Izumi! So cute!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.690
Seriously, adorable! So lovely!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.770
Izumi looks just like me when 
I was young, doesn't he?

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.390
He really does take after you!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.760
True, he does have really good genes.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.990
So how did he end up this way?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.380
The answer to that is probably...

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.250
<i>The true cause lay in a surprising place.</i>

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:08.360
Huh? Me?!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:10.120
After all,

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.370
you'd always eat the foods 
he didn't like for him.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.450
You'd always do all his homework

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.850
and take-home tests for him.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.520
And whenever he wants something, 
you immediately give it to him.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:23.690
But come on, come on, come on!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.840
He's so darn cute!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.000
Shougo!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.050
We've told you countless times that 
spoiling Izumi isn't doing him any good!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:30.720
But...

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:31.990
It's often said

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.340
you should send your darling 
child on a journey of his own.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.970
So you're showing me this to remind me

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.610
how much my brother dotes on me?

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.770
More like, how he's spoiled you rotten!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.890
Well, um...

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:46.610
That is,

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:50.300
it's to show you how concerned we all 
are about your future well-being.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.190
I know that already!

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.160
I really do know that, but...

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.160
But what?!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.790
I don't recall your parents 
raising you to be indecisive

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:58.120
and wishy-washy at the 
eleventh hour this way!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.460
That's what he says.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.240
They act like it was all my fault,

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.280
but it wasn't just me!

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:05.790
I'm home...

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.170
Welcome home, Izumi-san!

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:09.890
Do we have any snacks?

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:13.670
I bought you that cake 
you like from La Palette!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:14.680
Hurray!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.670
Can I have some black tea with it?

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:16.420
You certainly can.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:18.520
Two lumps of sugar and plenty of milk, right?

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:19.560
I'll put my bag away and be right back!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.430
Don't run on the stairs! You might slip!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.240
And make sure you wash your hands first!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.720
I will!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.070
Honestly! No matter how old he gets, he...

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:30.700
Huh?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.870
<i>Shougo was not the only culprit.</i>

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.700
What is it?

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.380
<i>Further testimony regarding Sagara's culpability</i>

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:39.160
<i>comes from Izumi's own mouth.</i>

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:44.580
<i>So Sagara-san is kind of 
like your second mom, Izumi?</i>

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.600
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.870
<i>But way stricter than a normal mom!</i>

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.130
<i>He's always saying stuff like, "Put your 
dirty clothes in the laundry basket!"</i>

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.420
<i>Or, "You can't play hooky from school!"</i>

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.780
<i>And, "Hold your chopsticks properly!"</i>

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.440
<i>And before bed he always 
says, "Brush your teeth!"</i>

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:57.740
<i>Or, "Do your homework!"</i>

00:08:57.740 --> 00:09:00.140
<i>And, "Don't be a picky eater!"</i>

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.560
<i>Aren't those all normal things 
for a good mother to say?</i>

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.620
<i>When Rei gets mad, he's insanely scary.</i>

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.770
<i>I'll never forget this one 
time when I was nine...</i>

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.530
A stranger told me he'd give 
me candy, so I went with him.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.210
And then...

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.410
Stop right there!

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.790
You bastard...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:32.400
Don't you touch our Izumi 
with your filthy hands!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.590
Die!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>So it isn't just your immediate 
family who's like that...</i>

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.740
<i>He might seriously murder me 
for running away from home!</i>

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.760
<i>So to date Izumi,</i>

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:47.030
<i>I'll have to win over Sagara-san, too, huh?</i>

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:48.670
<i>The hurdles just keep getting higher!</i>

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.880
<i>Pardon me. We're nearly there, 
so I'll turn off the meter here.</i>

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:53.980
<i>No, no, no! You don't have 
to! You don't have to!</i>

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.820
<b>August 3rd: The Sena Household</b>

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.390
<i>Good morning!</i>

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.590
<i>Since you'll be in show biz, 
too, starting tomorrow,</i>

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.120
<i>I've got a little advice for you!</i>

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.810
<i>The most important things are: 
#1 How you greet them, #2 how you greet them.</i>

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.310
<i>There's no #3 or #4, but #5, 
again, is how you greet them.</i>

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.130
<i>Show business...</i>

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.820
Why does Rei want me to debut?

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.930
—if that person believes in me, I can do anything...

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.430
Is that so?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:28.450
<i>A key player in bringing about Sena 
Izumi's debut was Sagara Rei,</i>

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.540
Then I suppose there's no helping it.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:30.200
Yes, please handle it like that.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:30.900
<i>a manager at Sena Productions.</i>

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.140
The press conference is 
scheduled for 4:00 PM,

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.920
so I'll have Izumi arrive at the 
hotel no later than 2:00 PM.

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:40.290
Please do.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:42.440
What about Ryouma?

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:45.300
He's scheduled to stay at the 
press conference's hotel tonight.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.250
What about the fax we'll 
send out to the press?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.370
This is it.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.000
Good, good.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.310
Then all that's left to do is wait for tomorrow.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.230
May I request one thing?

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:56.960
What?

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.780
If you have no objections,

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.180
may I serve as the emcee at tomorrow's event?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:08.160
This press conference will 
undoubtedly be a large one.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.600
If there is a familiar face in the crowd,

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.210
I feel it will help ease Izumi's nerves.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.070
A parent's love, huh?

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.660
I heard you were like a parent to Izumi.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.330
According to Ryouma, anyway.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:24.530
Yes. Well, something of the sort.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.320
I do find it odd...

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:30.210
Why would a man of your 
skills stay with Sena-Pro?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:31.830
Don't get me wrong.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.570
I know Sena Seiya, Sena Nagisa,

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.250
and Shougo are absolutely A-list celebrities.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.670
But there's a limit to how high you 
can go in a small private agency.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.630
Let me get to the point.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:44.510
Why don't you come work for me?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:46.520
Excuse me?

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.940
You did us a solid over this little incident.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.490
This is my thanks.

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.360
Your thanks? It is we who are indebted—

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:57.600
Covering up Ryouma's love scandal 
with the news of Izumi's debut...

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.860
That's not a move many would've thought to use.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.420
You've got a good head for planning.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.070
At this company, you'd have far 
more resources at your disposal.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.080
I humbly decline.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:16.240
I expected as much.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.840
Well, if you change your 
mind, come back anytime.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.680
You'd be very welcome.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:24.550
I am quite content where I currently am.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:30.990
He turned down a job offer 
from a company president...

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:33.400
If he were the type who 
could be won so easily,

00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:35.380
I wouldn't have offered.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:45.200
<i>There was a reason behind Sagara's 
devotion to Izumi's well-being.</i>

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.510
Ah, you're alive!

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:15.270
Thank goodness.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.690
You're hurt, aren't you?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.150
Let's get you to a hospital.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.120
I'd like for Izumi to use his own strength

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:29.160
to overcome his trauma from ten years ago.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.680
In fact, it's something 
he <i>must</i> overcome himself.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:41.020
Father said that about me?

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.450
Of course he did. He's your father, after all.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.630
The only one who can live up 
to those kind sentiments

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.660
is you, yourself, Izumi-san.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.040
Rei, I'll try hard.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:54.600
I'll go to the debut press conference!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.270
<i>It was Sagara's feelings 
that moved Izumi's heart.</i>

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.110
From "Izumi" to "IZUMI."

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.440
<b>August 4th: Day of the Debut Press Conference</b>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.910
<b>Ichijou Ryouma's 
Passionate Love Affair 
Revealed!</b>

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.160
<b>Photos of a 
Secret Date Inside!</b>

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.030
No! Not Ryouma!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.400
Who's the girl?

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.790
It appears that Ichijou Ryouma

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.540
did not return to his home last night.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.540
<i>Popular Celebrity Ichijou 
Ryouma Has a Girlfriend?! 
The Passionate Affair Revealed!!</i>

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.500
<i>We're reporting live from outside 
Ichijou Ryouma's talent agency, B-Dash.</i>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.420
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.170
This is the start of our festival!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.800
Mr. President! We've sent 
the fax out to the press!

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:29.930
Good!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.520
Now then, I'll go relay that info to 
the press gathered outside myself!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.000
Please refrain, sir.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.520
It'll turn into a madhouse.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:39.200
A fax is coming in from B-Dash!

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:41.980
<i>We will hold a press conference 
today at 4:00 PM</i>

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:45.230
<i>in the Golden Hall at the Kadonouchi Hotel.</i>

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:49.740
<i>Could this be anything other 
than... a marriage announcement?!</i>

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:51.530
Izumi-san?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.870
It's about time to head to the hotel—

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:55.610
Izumi-san?

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.320
Izumi-san! What are you doing?!

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.600
Open the door right now! Izumi-san!

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.710
I can't...

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.160
What do you mean you can't?!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.060
What are you doing in there?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.670
I don't know how I ever 
thought I could do this...

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.800
Sorry, I think I'm just 
gonna stay home today...

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.640
Why are you doing this <i>now?!</i>

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.250
This isn't only about you, you realize?

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:16.390
If you don't go, what do you 
think will happen to Ryouma?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.940
<b>I'll be waiting for you.
 —Ryouma</b>

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.820
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.240
<i>I'll just have to kick down the door...</i>

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.620
What are you doing, Rei?

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.780
We need to go.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.280
R-Right!

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:39.870
<i>What happened all of a sudden?</i>

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.200
<i>That's right. I decided I would do this.</i>

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:47.020
<i>There was no longer any 
indecision on Izumi's face.</i>

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:55.340
I wish we could be there with 
you. But do your best, son.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:58.390
He'll be fine! He's my baby, after all!

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.580
Yep!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.350
I'm heading out.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.820
<b>1 Hour To The Press Conference</b>

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.770
I hope Izumi's all right.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.540
He will come, won't he?

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.480
I'm so sorry we're late!

00:16:18.480 --> 00:16:18.990
Izumi!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.320
Ryouma.

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:22.870
Sagara-san, let me show you the program.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.400
Izumi, I'm glad you're here!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.980
Great job!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:24.770
R-Right...

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.880
Did you get enough sleep last night?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.550
I-I'm okay...

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.510
Huh? You look a little flushed.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.990
You don't have a fever, do you?

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:35.720
Onii-chan!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.310
Ryouma-kun...

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:41.600
Kindly refrain from touching 
my little Izumi so casually!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.690
What a surprise, Brother-in-Law!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:46.050
Where did you pop out from?

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:48.440
I was only checking whether 
Izumi had a fever!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.890
Ryouma-kun, you're the 
one with a hot head here!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.470
Same to you, Brother-in-Law!

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.990
Ignore the pointless displays of testosterone

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.650
and get Izumi into make-up, stat!

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:56.970
Yes, sir!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.700
<b>10 Minutes To The Press Conference</b>

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:00.700
All done!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.670
S-Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.820
So cute! So cute!

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.380
How dare you steal a hug from Izumi?!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.370
What's wrong with that? We're brothers!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.980
What?!

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:21.100
Both of you, stop that this instant!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.310
U-Um...

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:27.700
Thank you all for supporting 
my debut today...

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.480
Though I'll probably cause you some trouble,

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.490
thank you very much for your help!

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:38.600
It can't be helped. 
It's for Izumi's sake, so...

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.370
Let's join forces for now, Ryouma-kun!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.450
Agreed! Onii-san.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.880
Okay, it's time.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.830
Everyone, please standby!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.250
<b><i>Standby Room</i></b>

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.250
Wow, just look at that crowd...

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.000
Go, me.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.670
Izumi, are you doing okay?

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:03.260
D-D-D-D-D-D—

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.680
<b>*Clearly Not Okay</b>

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.680
<i>His voice isn't working!</i>

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:09.920
<i>What to do?</i>

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.700
<i>I don't have my good luck charm anymore.</i>

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.130
<i>How else can I calm his nerves down?</i>

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:16.380
Izumi.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.350
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.150
What if someone saw us?!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.240
We're fine.

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:29.330
More importantly...

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:31.190
How about one more?

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:32.940
A good luck kiss to calm the nerves?

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.880
H-How could you even ask that?!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.010
That's the spirit!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.420
Your voice is coming out again!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.970
Now that you mention it...

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.860
You'll be fine.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:45.930
I promise I'll take care of you.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:48.890
Whatever mistakes you make,

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.650
I'll back you up and smooth it over.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.110
Ichijou-san! It's time!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.700
Coming!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.030
Let's do our best.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:05.410
<i>It's true that my heart isn't 
pounding from nerves anymore.</i>

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.360
<i>But now... it's pounding 
for a different reason...</i>

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:23.340
<i>Beyond this door lies the start 
of a new life for Sena Izumi.</i>

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.530
<i>The curtain on that future is finally...</i>

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:27.140
<i>...rising.</i>

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.520
Love Stage.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.110
<b>Ichijou Ryouma Emergency Press Conference</b>

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.110
Thank you all for coming today.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.000
I am Sagara Rei of Sena Productions,

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.470
and I will be serving as your emcee today.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:47.330
We will now begin today's late-breaking 
press conference for Ichijou Ryouma.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.200
Why is someone from Sena-Pro here?

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.370
Beats me.

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:50.330
Let's bring him out now.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.540
Please welcome Ichijou Ryouma-san.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:03.620
I want to thank you all sincerely 
for coming out in such numbers,

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.220
despite our last-minute call.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:09.620
I'd also like to apologize for 
the recent uproar concerning me.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:13.040
The reason we asked you to join us today

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.970
was so that we could 
explain the truth behind

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:19.000
the alleged "love affair" photos 
that were published today.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.790
Is she your girlfriend?!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.720
How long have you been dating?

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.780
Um... Er...

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.280
I believe it would be easier 
to show you than explain.

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.440
Don't you think, Ichijou-san?

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:31.640
Yeah... probably.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.690
What?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.690
Then, please make the introduction.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.250
Right.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.500
Izumi-san! Come on in!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.170
Who's that?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.630
The "Happy Wedding" girl!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:57.760
Please allow me to introduce Izumi!

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:00.530
And our relationship is...

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.150
...just friends!

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.040
We won't believe that!

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.440
That can't be!

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:08.880
You don't call a press conference 
to introduce a friend!

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:11.080
Ichijou-san, you told us you 
would reveal the truth!

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:09.510
When did you meet?

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.520
Is she pregnant?

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:12.590
Have you set a date for the wedding?

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.590
Are you secretly engaged?

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:14.580
No! There's no wedding!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:17.380
And that's because...

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:18.750
He...

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.260
"He?"

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.390
...is a boy!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.060
Hey, hey, hey!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.390
Good work, everyone—WISH!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.590
Shougo, from CRUSHERZ?!

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:38.520
Why's he here?!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.930
This is my little brother Izumi, 
and he's making his show business debut!

00:21:41.930 --> 00:21:44.480
Everyone, please welcome him!

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:22.710
They got us good.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:23.880
Me, in a drama...

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:24.440
I have to escape!

00:23:24.440 --> 00:23:26.150
This scene is like deja vu!

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:27.550
It depends on the person.

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:28.470
I really am worried...

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:30.030
Never mind that!

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.970
<b><i>Which Way Is Right?</i></b>

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.500
Which way is right?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>My talent agency's president
 and his secretary.</b>
